<package name="cadcraft" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>Open-source CAD and drafting application</title>
  <description>CADCraft is an open-source computer-aided design and drafting
application with a command line, object snaps, layers, dimensions,
hatches and blocks. It opens and saves DXF and DWG drawings and
exports SVG and PNG.

This package provides the desktop application; the companion cadcraft-cli
subpackage provides the headless converter, exporter and MCP command server.</description>
  <url>https://github.com/storytold/cadcraft</url>
</package>
